  "originalQuery": "Your application is using Cloud SQL to store and manage e-commerce data. You notice intermittent connectivity issues, particularly during instance failovers or restarts. You want to improve application resiliency and minimize downtime. What should you do? (Choose two)",
  "originalOptions": "A. Use Private IP to connect to the Cloud SQL instance.<br/>B. Configure your application to retry failed transactions.<br/>C. Set a maintenance window during off-peak hours.<br/>D. Enable high availability (HA) for your Cloud SQL instance.<br/>E. Disable backups to reduce instance load.",
