  "qid": "193",
  "tip": "<p>When a scenario mentions brief connection drops during failover look for one platform feature that reduces downtime and one application pattern that tolerates transient errors. Pair managed HA with <i>retries</i> and be wary of options that only change connectivity or scheduling without improving availability.</p>",
